takes place.

00:16:19.078 --> 00:16:20.622
What's the worst case scenario?

00:16:20.646 --> 00:16:23.513
It may cause both of our
worlds to implode.

00:16:25.517 --> 00:16:27.429
If we do not return to our world,

00:16:27.453 --> 00:16:28.930
the merger will continue

00:16:28.954 --> 00:16:30.581
and we will not know the outcome
until it is too late.

00:16:32.124 --> 00:16:33.835
Merge? Oh, no! Implode?!

00:16:33.859 --> 00:16:36.829
Well, well, a very interesting theory.

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:39.696
How do you intend to prove it?

00:16:40.099 --> 00:16:44.263
| can't prove it until we
return to our world.

00:16:44.837 --> 00:16:47.898
You are free to believe anything
you wish to believe.

00:16:48.474 --> 00:16:52.934
By the way, how long have elves
held courtroom trials like ours?

00:16:53.412 --> 00:16:55.390
Oh, my goodness!

00:16:55.414 --> 00:16:56.992
She's right!

00:16:57.016 --> 00:16:58.693
We're merging!

00:16:58.717 --> 00:17:03.177
Order! Order! Order!

00:17:05.224 --> 00:17:06.634
| have made my decision!

00:17:06.658 --> 00:17:08.126
Hear now the verdict!

00:17:14.666 --> 00:17:19.748
The crimes committed by Celcia
Marikreel and her friends

00:17:19.772 --> 00:17:23.018
are inhumane and beyond reason.

00:17:23.042 --> 00:17:24.510
| find them guilty!

00:17:25.344 --> 00:17:27.506
And I sentence the elf hunters to
be removed from our world!

00:17:29.782 --> 00:17:31.409
You mean...

00:17:33.819 --> 00:17:35.430
Oh, thank you, your Honor!

00:17:35.454 --> 00:17:37.165
Oh, Ms. Airi!

00:17:37.189 --> 00:17:39.317
Hey, what's going to happen to us?

00:17:39.691 --> 00:17:42.092
We have to be removed
from this world.

00:17:42.694 --> 00:17:46.741
It means we have to get that last
fragment and get back to Japan!

00:17:46.765 --> 00:17:50.133
Hot damn! Righteousness wins out!

00:17:50.569 --> 00:17:52.037
Mistress Celcial

00:17:57.776 --> 00:17:59.244
There is no time to celebrate!

00:18:00.112 --> 00:18:02.624
If you are going to stop
this fusion of our worlds,

00:18:02.648 --> 00:18:06.278
you must find the final spell
fragment with all speed.

00:18:07.052 --> 00:18:08.520
Do you understand me?

00:18:09.088 --> 00:18:10.556
Yes, your Honor.

00:18:10.956 --> 00:18:13.935
I'll have the Bureau contact the
elders in the outlying areas

00:18:13.959 --> 00:18:15.927
and order their full cooperation.

00:18:16.462 --> 00:18:17.930
Thank you.

00:18:22.201 --> 00:18:26.648
All right, elf stripping is now an
officially sanctioned activity!

00:18:26.672 --> 00:18:28.883
We don't have to run from
the law any longer!

00:18:28.907 --> 00:18:30.875
Who wants to be the first lucky elf?

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:36.224
Hey, you.

00:18:36.248 --> 00:18:36.858
What are you looking at me for?
Hey, you.

00:18:36.882 --> 00:18:37.892
What are you looking at me for?

00:18:37.916 --> 00:18:40.462
What do you say we cut to the chase?

00:18:40.486 --> 00:18:42.648
We're looking for a spell fragment.

00:18:43.255 --> 00:18:44.899
Would you mind if we took
off your clothes?

00:18:44.923 --> 00:18:46.868
Under the authority of the Royal Bureau
of Investigation, of course.

00:18:46.892 --> 00:18:49.725
Hey, wait! I don't have it!

00:18:53.098 --> 00:18:54.075
Nice thighs!

00:18:54.099 --> 00:18:54.576
Not there, idiot!
Nice thighs!

00:18:54.600 --> 00:18:55.567
Not there, idiot!

00:18:57.069 --> 00:18:58.537
The final fragment!

00:18:59.404 --> 00:19:02.738
Come, lonely traveler, cast
yourself upon my body.

00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:09.346
Well, no big surprise there.
| saw it coming a mile away.

00:19:09.815 --> 00:19:12.477
More importantly, the spell
is complete again!

00:19:18.657 --> 00:19:20.591
It's back where it belongs.

00:19:20.959 --> 00:19:22.704
It looks just like this stupid dog
| once knew!

00:19:22.728 --> 00:19:23.872
Did you say something, meathead?

00:19:23.896 --> 00:19:24.205
It doesn't matter what it looks like! It just matters
that we did it! Did you say something, meathead?

00:19:24.229 --> 00:19:27.426
It doesn't matter what it looks like!
It just matters that we did it!

00:19:27.799 --> 00:19:29.878
We can go home now.

00:19:29.902 --> 00:19:32.269
International House of Curry,
here I come!

00:19:34.573 --> 00:19:36.041
Look at those crazy guys.

00:19:47.386 --> 00:19:50.098
It's time to go back, I guess.

00:19:50.122 --> 00:19:53.092
Yes, our extended vacation
has come to an end.

00:19:55.427 --> 00:20:00.108
Ms. Airi, Ritsuko, Junpei, we did it.

00:20:00.132 --> 00:20:01.964
Thank you all so very much.

00:20:02.701 --> 00:20:05.762
And now, I will begin the Ritual
of the Restoration Spell!

00:20:22.187 --> 00:20:23.951
Goodbye, my friends.

00:20:27.059 --> 00:20:28.891
Goodbye, Junpei.

00:20:29.628 --> 00:20:32.598
Oh, glorious people from another world
who shone brightly among us!

00:20:33.165 --> 00:20:35.634
| offer my deepest gratitude for
all you have done for us!

00:20:36.001 --> 00:20:39.247
And I liberate all souls that have
been summoned unto me!

00:20:39.271 --> 00:20:40.548
Celcial

00:20:40.572 --> 00:20:40.748
Junpei?
Celcial

00:20:40.772 --> 00:20:42.035
Junpei?

00:20:42.574 --> 00:20:44.269
Celcial

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:48.690
Return to your world in peace!

00:20:48.714 --> 00:20:50.458
Celcial

00:20:50.482 --> 00:20:52.293
Goodbye, my dear Junpei.

00:20:52.317 --> 00:20:55.582
Celcia, aren't you supposed
to be naked?

00:20:58.690 --> 00:21:01.660
Celcia, naked! It works better
if you're naked!

00:21:03.128 --> 00:21:09.261
You idiot! Why do I have to be naked
when the ritual is almost complete?

00:21:10.302 --> 00:21:11.963
I've got a bad feeling about this.

00:21:12.571 --> 00:21:14.437
| feel a surprise ending coming on.

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:17.002
Mistress Celcia, concentrate
on your ritual!

00:21:30.789 --> 00:21:33.268
Celcia, you did it to us again!

00:21:33.292 --> 00:21:34.760
Let me at him!

00:21:54.479 --> 00:22:01.562
Yaru ki ga nai hi wa yasunda mo ii yo

00:22:01.586 --> 00:22:08.219
Jinsei wa nagakutte kimagure da kara

00:22:08.593 --> 00:22:15.677
Watashi wa anata o hyakubai ni dekiru

00:22:15.701 --> 00:22:18.913
Sore ja mou nechaimashou

00:22:18.937 --> 00:22:22.396
Sotto daitete ne

00:22:22.841 --> 00:22:27.802
Kyouryuu ni atta te

00:22:29.915 --> 00:22:36.631
Wa haha to warau, sonna hito

00:22:36.655 --> 00:22:43.338
Hana mo arashi mo hora fumikoenagara

00:22:43.362 --> 00:22:50.945
Jidai ga kawatte iku kenai ga kikoeru

00:22:50.969 --> 00:22:57.652
Sui mo amai mo baby, kamiwakenagara

00:22:57.676 --> 00:23:00.676
Kujikenaide ne tensai wa
saigo ni kuru no
